{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01173",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 5.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "doctor, we're ready in room two, I've already taken the observations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.99,
      "end_seconds": 11.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.5,
      "end_seconds": 16.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Mainly I've been passing clots. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.15,
      "end_seconds": 20.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.23,
      "end_seconds": 31.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "Around three days... no wait, it's more like ten days. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.62,
      "end_seconds": 35.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "have you had very heavy periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.72,
      "end_seconds": 56.94,
      "duration_seconds": 17.22,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. And there's cramping pain in the lower tummy as well, three days now. About cramping pain in the lower tummy, I'd say once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.78,
      "end_seconds": 62.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "alright, have you been passing clots at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.81,
      "end_seconds": 71.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.92,
      "end_seconds": 89.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.23,
      "end_seconds": 99.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "I had a reaction to tramadol when I was younger, feeling very drowsy, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.44,
      "end_seconds": 103.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.13,
      "end_seconds": 110.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "yes, I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder, two years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.2,
      "end_seconds": 117.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.09,
      "end_seconds": 132.57,
      "duration_seconds": 14.48,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.58,
      "end_seconds": 138.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Okay, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.46,
      "end_seconds": 145.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid for nearly five years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.61,
      "end_seconds": 148.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.89,
      "end_seconds": 152.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.5,
      "end_seconds": 162.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Yes, an underactive thyroid is known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.2,
      "end_seconds": 180.67,
      "duration_seconds": 17.47,
      "text": "I take Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage. It's something called losa... losartan, 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.61,
      "end_seconds": 185.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "So, is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.24,
      "end_seconds": 190.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "not with me. I'll bring it next time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.28,
      "end_seconds": 207.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "A few quick ones: weight loss, fever or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.65,
      "end_seconds": 210.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.86,
      "end_seconds": 215.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "any sign of pain during sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.05,
      "end_seconds": 219.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Not at all, no pain during sex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.93,
      "end_seconds": 223.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "so, how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.77,
      "end_seconds": 230.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.75,
      "end_seconds": 236.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.78,
      "end_seconds": 239.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 239.99,
      "end_seconds": 249.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pressure 122 over 80, saturation 98 percent, temp 36.9 degrees. Respiratory rate 17, heart rate 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.77,
      "end_seconds": 250.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.49,
      "end_seconds": 257.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.33,
      "end_seconds": 259.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.33,
      "end_seconds": 276.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "You look a little pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.5,
      "end_seconds": 279.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.7,
      "end_seconds": 296.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "the tummy is soft, a little tender in the lower part, and there's no mass"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.99,
      "end_seconds": 308.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.37,
      "end_seconds": 325.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.84,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check okay, so my impression is this: This is probably heavy periods with a cause still to find it could also be a hormonal imbalance, so we'll keep that open"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.91,
      "end_seconds": 329.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.28,
      "end_seconds": 353.09,
      "duration_seconds": 21.81,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now heavy periods with a cause still to find is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'll request a pregnancy test, it'll help with abnormal bleeding. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.55,
      "end_seconds": 359.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "yes, will do"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.96,
      "end_seconds": 364.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "right, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.91,
      "end_seconds": 369.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}